  "description": "Middleware for ASP.NET Core applications that run behind AspNetCoreSharedServer: UseAspNetCoreSharedServer advertises HTTP/3\n            on the public port of the server by sending the Alt-Svc header that AspNetCoreSharedServer provides, and reads its PROXY protocol header when it sends one.\n            AspNetCoreSharedServer is a proxy HTTP server for serving ASP.NET Core Kestrel behind a proxy like Apache or Nginx in shared hosting to only\n            start Kestrel on demand and shut it down when idle.",
